Error [jet.UnsupportedCompileTimeValue]: `#run value` is used inside a larger value, which this compiler does not support yet
  --> tests/ui/e0391_run_operand_inside_value.jet:8:38
    |
  8 |     pair: Pair{name: "answer", size: #run 42}
    |                                      ^^^^^^^
 Why: Today only a binding's whole value, `name: #run value`, is evaluated while building
 Fix: Bind the value as `name: #run value` first, then use `name` here
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0391
